# Panel motion

Sheets, menus, dropdowns, accordions, and other panels use house springs from
`src/theme/motion.ts`.

## Source of truth

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| House open / expand / sheets | `panelSpringConfig` (damping **0.9**, response **0.15s**) |
| Dismiss / collapse | `panelExitSpringConfig` (damping **0.9**, response **0.15s**) |
| Options menu | `menuSpringConfig` (damping **0.9**, response **0.15s**) |
| Reduced motion fade | `animateWithMotionPreference` → **150ms** |
| Press scale | `ScaledPressable` / `usePressScale` — **0.97** over **150ms** |
| Flick projection | `projectMomentum` (**0.99**) |
| Soft edges | `rubberband` (**0.6**) |
| First-paint stagger | `ENTER_STAGGER_MS` (**30**) |
| Page slides | `slideTransitionTiming` — **300ms**, bezier **(0.24, 1, 0.33, 1)** |

## Rules

- Do not hardcode spring params, press scale, or fade durations in components
- Prefer `ScaledPressable` for pressable chrome (not text-field shells)
- Use `panelExitSpringConfig` for collapses / hides; `panelSpringConfig` for opens
- Bottom sheets: pass `panelSpringConfig` into `useBottomSheetSpringConfigs`
